<!--
    Entitlements for OpenFallout-CS.app (the editor), applied with the hardened runtime when the package is signed
    with a Developer ID identity. The editor runs no Lua, so it needs none of the game's JIT entitlements.
    Never add com.apple.security.get-task-allow here: it must not be present in a release.
-->
